# ================= 数据集图片与原始归档 =================
# 仅入库 labels / manifests / data.yaml，图片不入库
# 原因：体积（约 9.2 GB）+ 第三方图片版权
datasets/**/images/
datasets/**/viz/
datasets/taco/raw/*
# 例外：保留 TACO 来源溯源材料（体积小，是复现依据；不含图片与归档）
!datasets/taco/raw/SOURCE.md
!datasets/taco/raw/*.log
!datasets/taco/raw/annotations_from_release.json
!datasets/taco/raw/release_metadata/
*.zip

# ================= 模型权重 =================
# 建议通过 GitHub Release 分发，或使用 Git LFS
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.engine
*.torchscript
runs/**/weights/

# ================= 训练产物 =================
runs/**/train*/
runs/**/predict*/
wandb/
*.tfevents

# ================= Python =================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ================= 编辑器 / 系统 =================
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
